LocHelpText="Gain additional bonuses depending on the status effects the target is affected by."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Acid Burning</font> - Attacks shred +<Ability:M31_Malevolence_AcidBurning_ShredBonus> armor.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Bleeding</font> - Attacks have +<Ability:M31_Malevolence_Bleeding_CritBonus> critical chance and deal +<Ability:M31_Malevolence_Bleeding_CritDamageBonus> critical damage.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Burning</font> - Attacks increase the damage the target takes from damage-over-time effects by <Ability:M31_Malevolence_Burning_DOTDamageBonus> for <Ability:M31_Malevolence_Burning_DebuffDuration> turns. Doesn't stack.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Poisoned</font> - Attacks reduce the target's critical chance by <Ability:M31_Malevolence_Poisoned_CritPenalty> and increase the graze chance by <Ability:M31_Malevolence_Poisoned_GrazePenalty> for <Ability:M31_Malevolence_Poisoned_DebuffDuration> turns. Stacks.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Hypothermia</font> - Attacks reduce the target's aim by <Ability:M31_Malevolence_Frost_AimPenalty> and defense by <Ability:M31_Malevolence_Frost_DefensePenalty> for <Ability:M31_Malevolence_Frost_DebuffDuration> turns. Stacks.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Radiation</font> - Attacks reduce the target's damage by <Ability:M31_Malevolence_Radiation_DamageReductionPrc> for <Ability:M31_Malevolence_Radiation_DebuffDuration> turns. Doesn't stack.<br><Bullet> <font color='#df07b7'>Requiem Corrosion</font> or <font color='#ffd700'>Psionic Rippling</font> - Attacks gain double bonus damage from Rupture."

