LocLongDescription="<font color='#0bff9b'>Aid Protocol</font> and <font color='#0bff9b'>Strongold Protocol</font> also increase the target's aim by <Ability:M31_TargetingAid_AimBonus> and critical chance by <Ability:M31_TargetingAid_CritBonus>."
LocHelpText="<font color='#0bff9b'>Aid Protocol</font> and <font color='#0bff9b'>Strongold Protocol</font> also increase the target's aim by <Ability:M31_TargetingAid_AimBonus> and critical chance by <Ability:M31_TargetingAid_CritBonus>."
