[M31_TrackingFire X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Tracking Fire"
LocLongDescription="Take a shot at the target. <Ability:M31_FreeAction>. Counts as reaction fire. Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown> turn cooldown. The cooldown is reduced by <Ability:M31_TrackingFire_CooldownReduction> after each melee attack."
LocHelpText="Take a shot at the target. <Ability:M31_FreeAction>. Counts as reaction fire. The cooldown is reduced by <Ability:M31_TrackingFire_CooldownReduction> after each melee attack."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Can be used while the soldier has at least one standard, Run and Gun or movement-only action.<br><Bullet> Cooldown can be reset by Bladestorm and other reaction attacks: <Ability:M31_TrackingFire_bAllowResetFromBladestorm>."
LocFlyOverText="Tracking Fire"

