LocFlyOverText="Advanced Traverse Fire"

[M31_TroubleShooter X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Trouble Shooter"
LocLongDescription="Your standard shots permanently reduce the target's hack defense by <Ability:M31_TroubleShooter_HackDefenseReduction>. This effect cannot stack."
LocHelpText="Your standard shots permanently reduce the target's hack defense by <Ability:M31_TroubleShooter_HackDefenseReduction>. This effect cannot stack."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Standard shot abilities also include Standard Sniper Shot, Light 'Em Up, Pistol Shot and Snap Shot."

[M31_Undertaker X2AbilityTemplate]
