[M31_WatchfulEye X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Eyeful Watch"
LocLongDescription="Whenever you holotarget an enemy, gain a free reaction shot against them until the start of your next turn."
LocHelpText="Whenever you holotarget an enemy, gain a free reaction shot against them until the start of your next turn."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Affected by <font color='#0bff9b'>Independent Tracking</font>.<br><Bullet> Applies only to the primary target of the ability.<br><Bullet> Does not apply to Holo Targeting passive. Only Holotargeter abilities are eligible for this ability.<br><Bullet> The attack will not activate while the soldier is concealed.<br><Bullet> The attack activates whenever marked units move or attack."

