LocHelpText="Your <Ability:M31_BoundWeaponName> attacks inflict bleeding, dealing <Ability:M31_Bloodlet_BleedDamage> of the target's max HP (rounded up) damage per turn for <Ability:M31_Bloodlet_BleedDuration> turn(s)."
