LocHelpText="Your <Ability:M31_BoundWeaponName> attacks cause Thermal Shock, reducing the target's aim by <Ability:M31_ThermalShock_AimPenalty> and defense by <Ability:M31_ThermalShock_DefensePenalty> for <Ability:M31_ThermalShock_Duration> turn(s). Penalties are doubled against enemies immune to frost."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Applies to most <Ability:M31_BoundWeaponName> attacks.<br><Bullet> Multiple applications of the debuff will not stack."

