[M31_Chimera X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Chimera"
LocLongDescription="The <Ability:ClassName> can now equip <font color='#ffd700'>cannons</font>, <font color='#ffd700'>sniper rifles</font>, <font color='#ffd700'>vektor rifles</font>, <font color='#ffd700'>bullpups</font>, and <font color='#ffd700'>ripjacks</font>, and gains additional abilities depending on the weapons equipped."
LocHelpText="The <Ability:ClassName> can now equip <font color='#ffd700'>cannons</font>, <font color='#ffd700'>sniper rifles</font>, <font color='#ffd700'>vektor rifles</font>, <font color='#ffd700'>bullpups</font>, and <font color='#ffd700'>ripjacks</font>, and gains additional abilities depending on the weapons equipped."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>SMG</font>: <font color='#0bff9b'>Airstrike</font> - Once per mission, call in an airstrike that does damage in a large area.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Rifle</font>: <font color='#0bff9b'>Cyclic Fire</font> - Fire three shots at a target in a single attack.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Boltcaster</font>: <font color='#0bff9b'>Pinpoint</font> - Special shot that has bonus aim, critical chance and critical damage for each action consumed.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Shotgun</font>: <font color='#0bff9b'>Assault Shot</font> - Fire a shot against a target within a <Ability:M31_AssaultShot_Range> tile radius. Free action, but can't crit. Has a <Ability:M31_AssaultShot_Cooldown> turn cooldown.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Cannon</font>: <font color='#0bff9b'>Saturation Fire</font> - Fire a cone shaped barrage of bullets at every enemy in an area. Deals high damage to cover.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Sniper Rifle</font>: <font color='#0bff9b'>Squadsight</font> and <font color='#0bff9b'>Double Tap</font> - Fire a standard shot and gain a second action restricted to an additional shot or overwatching.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Vektor Rifle</font>: <font color='#0bff9b'>Squadsight</font> and <font color='#0bff9b'>Burst Fire</font> - Fire an automatic <Ability:M31_BurstFire_NumShots>-shot burst. Has a <Ability:M31_BurstFire_Cooldown> turn cooldown.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Bullpup</font>: <font color='#0bff9b'>Battlelord</font> - Activate to take an action after each enemy in line of sight takes a turn.<br><br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Sword</font>: <font color='#0bff9b'>Overpower</font> - Dashing melee attack. Stuns the target and shreds all of its armor. Non-large units only.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Combat Knife</font>: <font color='#0bff9b'>Crippling Blow</font> - Crippling slash against an adjecent enemy. Inflicts a permanent non-stacking debuff that severely reduces the target's mobility, aim and dodge.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Ripjack</font>: <font color='#0bff9b'>Combat Advance</font> - Dashing melee attack. Costs a single action, doesn't end the turn, and grants a movement-only action. Has a <Ability:M31_CombatAdvance_Cooldown> turn cooldown.<br><br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Pistol</font>: <font color='#0bff9b'>Frantic Fire</font> - As a free action, fire the pistol at 2 random enemies.<br><Bullet> <font color='#ffd700'>Sidearm</font>: <font color='#0bff9b'>Sidearm Rave</font> - Fire the pistol three times at the same target. Woefully inaccurate."



